中的分子配上“手机” 微型芯片可实时监测实验过程","summary":"【给化学反应中的分子配上“手机” 微型芯片可实时监测实验过程】把一枚比米粒还小的微型芯片放入试管底部，就能像手机一样与正在发生的化学反应“对话”，每隔半秒采集并无线传输一组数据，让化学反应实时“报告”自身状态——这是美国斯坦福大学和康奈尔大学研究团队开发出的名为“反应遥测”的新技术，实现了对化学反应过程的实时监测，有望加快新药发现和新材料研发。相关论文近日发表于《科学》杂志。","date":"2026-11-23","source":"东方财富快讯","url":"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202611233937033084.html","kind":"资讯","entityCodes":["159813","CN-UNASSIGNED"],"entities":[{"kind":"fund","code":"159813","name":"半导体ETF鹏华","basis":"source-security-code"},{"kind":"unassigned","code":"CN-UNASSIGNED","name":"待归属资讯","basis":"source-read-entity-unresolved"}],"summaryBasis":"source-excerpt","sourceRecordId":"fast:202611233937033084","publishedAt":"2026-11-23 07:28:47","topics":[{"id":"other","label":"其他"}],"entityHints":[],"contentCoverage":"source-feed","originPublishedAt":null,"publicationTimeBasis":"source-feed-publish-or-show-time","eventOccurredAt":null,"sourceSecurityRefs":null,"sources":[{"url":"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202611233937033084.html","source":"东方财富快讯"}]},{"id":"evt-6e755c6b801de1b54a14350b","entityCode":"159813","entityName":"半导体ETF鹏华","title":"美股纳指高开近7% 英伟达大涨33% 芯片股集体高开","summary":"【美股纳指高开近7% 英伟达大涨33% 芯片股集体高开】美股三大指数大幅高开，道琼斯指数涨2.78%，标普500指数涨4.93%，纳斯达克综合指数涨6.95%。受黄仁勋CEO职务恢复的消息刺激，芯片股集体高开，英伟达涨超33%，闪迪涨超24%，希捷科技涨超21%，台积电涨超20%，ARM、西部数据、拉姆研究、应用材料涨超17%，美光科技、Cerebras、英特尔涨超15%。","date":"2026-11-23","source":"东方财富快讯","url":"https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202611233937627710.html","kind":"资讯","entityCodes":["159813","CN-UNASSIGNED"],"entities":[{"kind":"fund","code":"159813","name":"半导体ETF鹏华","basis":"source-security-code"},{"kind":"unassigned","code":"CN-UNASSIGNED","name":"待归属资讯","basis":"source-read-entity-unresolved"}],"summaryBasis":"source-excerpt","sourceRecordId":"fast:202611233937627710","publishedAt":"2026-11-23 22:31:04","topics":[{"id":"other","label":"其他"}],"entityHints":[],"contentCoverage":"source-feed","originPublishedAt":null,"publicationTimeBasis":"source-feed-publish-or-show-time","eventOccurredAt":null,"sourceSecurityRefs"